## 🚀 Quick Setup Instructions

### Option A: Windows Users (Easiest - 2 Steps)

```bash
# Step 1: Download & run EXE
# (Not yet available - first build it)
python build_exe.py

# Step 2: Run the EXE
# double-click dist/arcanova.exe
```

### Option B: Local Development (3 Steps)

```bash
# Step 1: Install dependencies
python install_dependencies.py --gpu

# Step 2: Run Streamlit app
streamlit run app.py

# Step 3: Open browser
# http://localhost:8501
```

### Option C: Manual Setup (5 Steps)

```bash
# Step 1: Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate

# Step 2: Install PyTorch (GPU)
pip install torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu121

# Step 3: Install other dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Step 4: Run app
streamlit run app.py

# Step 5: Enjoy!
# App is live at http://localhost:8501
```

