## 🔧 Customization Files

### To Customize Behavior

Edit `src/config.py`:
```python
# Change defaults
self.default_max_tokens = 400  # Longer stories
self.default_temperature = 0.8  # More creative
```

### To Customize UI

Edit `app.py`:
```python
# Change story modes
story_modes = [...]  # Add your own

# Change colors
st.markdown("<style>...</style>")  # Custom CSS
```

### To Customize Models

Edit `config.example.json`:
```json
{
  "qwen_model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B",
  "tts_backend": "piper"
}
```

